<title>UK: Wuerttembergische Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttembergische Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY  **14.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.95     PAY DATE  S-03.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO JAN 1997 THEN STEPS UP TO 5.0 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     **CALLABLE AT PAR ON 14.JAN.97</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    STUTT     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
